<title>USA: RENO AIR JULY LOAD FACTOR RISES.</title>
<headline>RENO AIR JULY LOAD FACTOR RISES.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reno Air Inc Thursday said its load factor rose in July to 73.6 percent, an increase of 2.6 load factor points over July, 1996.</p>
<p>The airline carried a record 530,854 passengers, representing an increase of 11.6 percent over the same period last year.  During the month of July, Reno Air flew 311,859,740 revenue passenger miles (RPMs) with a capacity of 423,629,221 available seat miles (ASMs).</p>
<p>		  RENO AIR JULY TRAFFIC RESULTS</p>
<p>		    1997		  1996	  Percent Change</p>
<p>RPMs (000)	 311,860	    298,487		  4.5%</p>
<p>     ASMs (000)  423,629	    420,287		  0.8%</p>
<p>     Load Factor (%) 73.6		 71.0	  2.6 points</p>
<p>     Passengers  530,854	    475,887		 11.6%</p>
<p>		  RENO AIR YEAR-TO-DATE TRAFFIC STATISTICS</p>
<p>			     Seven Months Ended July 31</p>
<p>		    1997		  1996	  Percent Change</p>
<p>RPMs (000)	 1,836,986	  1,713,568		  7.2%</p>
<p>     ASMs (000)  2,702,224	  2,536,712		  6.5%</p>
<p>     Load Factor (%)  68.0		 67.5	  0.5 points</p>
<p>     Passengers  3,208,672	  2,871,986		 11.7%</p>
